            <note corresp="#d11-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d11-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, POL 26 S VIET Top Secret; Emergency.
                    Received at 4:42 a.m. and passed to the White House at 4:52 a.m.</p>
            </note>
